  "What this simulation evaluates": "模拟器的求值范围",
  "This page evaluates the structured selections above, not arbitrary PromQL text. It supports exact and RE2 regex label matchers, finite float samples, a 5-minute instant lookback with an excluded left boundary (Prometheus 3.15), left-open/right-closed ranges, the listed rollups, counter reset handling and rate extrapolation, aggregations, grouping, scalar arithmetic, unary signs and filtering comparisons. Rate/increase model Prometheus behavior. Histograms, stale markers, vector joins, MetricsQL-specific evaluation and server storage behavior are outside this simulator. Use a real backend to validate production results. Sample values are limited to ±1e12 and timestamps to millisecond precision to bound this demo.": "本页只计算上方结构化选项，不执行任意 PromQL 文本。支持精确和 RE2 正则标签匹配、有限浮点样本、排除左边界的 5 分钟即时回看（Prometheus 3.15）、左开右闭范围、列出的窗口函数、计数器重置与速率外推、聚合、分组、标量算术、一元符号和过滤式比较。rate/increase 模拟 Prometheus 行为。不包含直方图、陈旧标记、向量连接、MetricsQL 专有求值或服务器存储行为；生产结果应在真实后端验证。为限制示例开销，样本值限定为 ±1e12，时间戳精确到毫秒。",
